    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# **Project Title :-** Predicting Heart Disease Risk Using Logistic Regression on a Health Behavior Dataset"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vZy5ZbxJFYGL"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# **Introduction to the Dataset**\n",
        "\n",
        "The Heart Disease Dataset is a health-related dataset that captures various lifestyle, medical, and demographic factors to predict whether an individual is likely to have heart disease. It is widely used for classification tasks in machine learning and public health research to study correlations between health conditions and heart disease risk.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dataset Overview**\n",
        "Each row in the dataset represents an individual and contains multiple features related to physical health, lifestyle habits, and demographics, along with the target variable HeartDisease which indicates whether the individual has heart disease or not.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Column Descriptions:**\n",
        "* **HeartDisease:** Target variable. \"Yes\" if the person has heart disease, \"No\" otherwise.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **BMI:** Body Mass Index, a numeric value indicating the body fat based on height and weight.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Smoking:** \"Yes\" if the person has smoked at least 100 cigarettes in their life.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **AlcoholDrinking:** \"Yes\" if the person consumes heavy amounts of alcohol.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Stroke:** \"Yes\" if the person has ever had a stroke.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **PhysicalHealth:** Number of days (in the past 30) when the person's physical health was not good.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **MentalHealth:** Number of days (in the past 30) when the person's mental health was not good.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **DiffWalking:** \"Yes\" if the person has serious difficulty walking or climbing stairs.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Sex:** Gender of the individual (Male/Female).\n",
        "\n",
        "* **AgeCategory:** Categorical representation of the age group (e.g., 40-44, 55-59, 80 or older).\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Race:** Ethnic background (e.g., White, Black, etc.).\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Diabetic:** \"Yes\" if the person is diabetic.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **PhysicalActivity:** \"Yes\" if the person has done physical activity or exercise in the past 30 days.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **GenHealth:** Self-reported general health status (Excellent, Very good, Good, Fair, Poor).\n",
        "\n",
        "* **SleepTime:** Average number of hours of sleep per night.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Asthma:** \"Yes\" if the person has asthma.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **KidneyDisease:** \"Yes\" if the person has kidney disease.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **SkinCancer:** \"Yes\" if the person has had skin cancer."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7p3Kq4G5FiRH"
      }
    },
